    "paths": "file paths are relative to fnb-library/motions/.",
    "units": "Seconds for time; 1080x1920 design pixels for x/y; degrees for additive rotation; scale multiplies authored scale; opacity is absolute.",
    "targetResolution": "For component motions include the instance root when matching data-animate, as well as matching descendants. Definitions specify alternatives or all-target selection in behavior.",
    "sceneRoles": "Transition targets incoming/outgoing are scene presentation roles supplied by the composer, not data-animate hooks.",
    "duration": "duration is local per-target motion duration for components, and complete handoff duration for transitions. With stagger, group span is duration + max(0,count-1)*behavior.stagger.",
